!==================================================================
!
! GSD_TREE
!
! CI wavefunction from a reference "ground" determinant (G) with
! all "singles" excitations (S) within a given window, and with
! possibly with "doubles" (D) within another given window.
! In the latter case the doubles are associated via a recursive
! data structure.
!
